p07 : V4.4
p08 : US Blanks 6'5X"EPS (2010 catalog vector extraction; catalog volume unavailable)
p97 : At 2-3/4” maximum thickness, this blank is identical to the previous version with 1/4” additional thickness along the entire length. Designed for high performance short boards up to 20-1/4” in width, and will also accommodate small Fish models due to the extra thickness. An ideal blank for machine shaping.
